                "title": "Full Stack Web Developer",
                "summary": "Passionate Java developer.\nEnthusiastic about creating innovative solutions.\nDedicated to continuous learning and growth.",
                "longSummary": "A highly motivated and results-oriented recent graduate with a Bachelor of Arts in Computer Science and a minor in Business from Southwestern University, I possess over four years of experience in software development and IT support.  My expertise spans full-stack development using technologies like React, Flask, FastAPI, and PostgreSQL, coupled with experience in data visualization and API design.  My research background includes AI-driven dungeon generation (Java) and analyzing GitHub collaboration patterns, culminating in a presentation at the World Conference on Computational Intelligence.  Passionate about leveraging technology for innovative solutions, I'm also an active open-source contributor, evidenced by my Minecraft plugin with 2K+ downloads. My career philosophy centers on continuous learning and building impactful applications."
            },
